careful, slanted handwriting. It said,

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,920
’Please stop pacing at
three in the morning. I can

5
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:16,980
hear every step. Thank
you. Ruth downstairs.’

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,840
I read it three times,
standing in the hallway

7
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,300
