19
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:55,920
my bed across the room with me in it and I

20
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:56,720
didn’t notice.

21
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:00,220
The apartment itself
was the upstairs half of

22
00:01:00,220 --> 00:01:02,720
an old house in Columbus, Ohio. Hardwood

23
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:05,400
floors, radiators that
clanked every time the

24
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,820
