25
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:10,560
from the living room past the
bathroom to my bedroom at the back.

26
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:13,760
There was a narrow coat
closet in that hallway

27
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:16,300
