33
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:33,440
That evening, I knocked on Ruth’s door to
apologize anyway. She was sweet about it.

34
00:01:33,780 --> 00:01:35,580
She said she hadn’t
wanted to bother me, but

35
00:01:35,580 --> 00:01:37,360
it had been going on for a few weeks and

36
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:40,240
