for twenty minutes or so. Then it stopped,

42
00:01:57,040 --> 00:02:01,560
and she heard a door close. I told
her it couldn’t have been me. I told

43
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:03,460
her about the early shifts
and how heavy a sleeper

44
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:06,400
I was. She gave me this kind, patient

45
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:11,220
look, the way you’d look at a student who
swore they’d done their homework, and said

46
00:02:11,380 --> 00:02:14,480
maybe I was sleepwalking.
She said her late husband

47
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:16,020
