49
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:22,200
I got back upstairs, I
noticed little things

50
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,500
I’d been ignoring. The thermostat was set

51
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:26,460
to sixty-eight, and I always
kept it at sixty-five

52
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:28,120
because the heat was expensive. There was

53
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:32,440
a grey hoodie I’d been looking for since
Christmas, and I’d assumed I left it at

54
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:35,400
my sister’s. A container
of leftover pasta I

55
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,640
was sure I hadn’t finished was gone from

56
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:40,180
the fridge. Every one
of those things had an

57
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:42,620
easy explanation, and every one of them,

58
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:46,220
