83
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:08,920
And then, very faintly,
I heard breathing, slow

84
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:12,000
and even, right outside my bedroom door,

85
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:16,180
while I was asleep on
the other side of it. I

86
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:18,140
sat in my car in the
