minute four times. Then

88
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:23,000
the steps went back up
the hallway, slowly,

89
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,800
and I heard a soft click,
like a door being pulled

90
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:28,920
shut. The only door in that hallway,

91
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:31,520
