couch, the kitchen doorway,

104
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:08,380
and the start of the hallway. I tested

105
00:05:08,380 --> 00:05:11,480
it with my phone. The
picture was grainy, but in

106
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,220
night mode, you could
see everything in shades

107
00:05:13,220 --> 00:05:16,340
of grey. Then I packed
a bag and went to sleep

108
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:18,920
at my sister’s place.
I told myself it was an

109
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,980
