notification woke me up. Motion detected,

115
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:45,040
living room, at 3.14 a.m. I opened the
feed, and there was a man in my apartment.

116
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:49,180
He was standing in the
middle of my living room,

117
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:52,180
barefoot, in the grey
hoodie I’d been missing

118
00:05:52,180 --> 00:05:56,000
since Christmas. He was
thin, maybe in his forties,

119
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,420
with his hair grown out
and pushed behind his

120
00:05:58,180 --> 00:06:01,180
ears. He wasn’t searching
for anything. He wasn’t

121
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:03,480
